<article class="env-remark" id="0ANI">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0ANI">Remark <span data-tag="0ANI">87.21.5</span> <span class="named">(Variant for Noetherian)</span>.</a>  Let $P$ be a property of morphisms of $\textit{WAdm}^{Noeth}$. We say $P$ is a <em>local property</em> if axioms (<a href="/tag/0AND" data-tag="0AND">1</a>), (<a href="/tag/0ANE" data-tag="0ANE">2</a>), (<a href="/tag/0ANF" data-tag="0ANF">3</a>), of Situation <a href="/tag/0CBA" data-tag="0CBA">87.21.2</a> hold for morphisms of $\textit{WAdm}^{Noeth}$. In exactly the same way we obtain a variant of Lemma <a href="/tag/0ANG" data-tag="0ANG">87.21.3</a> for morphisms between locally Noetherian formal algebraic spaces over $S$. </p>
</article>